<title>AUSTRIA: AMS details parent results for 1996.</title>
<headline>AMS details parent results for 1996.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of schillings unless stated)</p>
<p>					    1996	   1995</p>
<p> Parent sales			  1,275.5	1,698.1</p>
<p> Parent operating profit	     156.0	  297.1</p>
<p> Parent pre-tax profit		 172.2	  291.9</p>
<p> Parent net income		     107.7	  217.3</p>
<p> Parent order entry		  1,028.5	1,499.0</p>
<p> Parent order backlog (on Dec 31)  300.2	  547.8</p>
<p> Parent personnel expenses	   395.6	  395.8</p>
<p> Parent depreciation		   161.3	  147.4</p>
<p>NOTE - The full name of the company is Austria Mikro Systeme International.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12 253</p>
</text>
